.TH "XRINPUTSOURCESCHANGEEVENT.SESSION" "3JS" "September 29, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
XRInputSourcesChangeEvent.session \- XRInputSourcesChangeEvent: session
property
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Secure context:\f[R] This feature is available only in secure
contexts (HTTPS).
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]session\f[B]\f[R] read\-only property of the
\f[CR]XRInputSourcesChangeEvent\f[R] interface specifies the
\f[CR]XRSession\f[R] to which the input source list change event
applies.
.SH VALUE
An \f[CR]XRSession\f[R] indicating the WebXR session to which the input
source list change applies.
